  "title": "The Commandments — The Church and Its Mission",
  "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"2.5rem\",\"bottom\":\"4rem\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4rem\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#b3261e\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#b3261e\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"fontSize\":\"2.6rem\"}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#b3261e;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:2.6rem\">The Church and Its Mission</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/instructions/\">Read Instructions</a> · <a href=\"/instructions/instructions-index/\">Instructions index</a> · <a href=\"/instructions/beyond-the-torah/\">Beyond the Torah</a> · <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/individual-command-counting-method/\">Counting and classification guide</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This page preserves the numbered Christ studies and their quoted passages. <a href=\"/instructions/the-church-and-its-mission/\">Open the complementary Harmony study</a>. The two views serve different purposes; their entry counts are not added together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Verified Saints Translation links.</strong> Biblical references open the Saints chapter at its exact verse anchor. Saints numbering appears first; corresponding KJV numbers are shown where they differ. Ranges open at their first verse. <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/#citation-audit\">Read the citation and numbering notes</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"saints-pericope\"} -->\n<p class=\"saints-pericope\">The Commandments of Christ · His own commandments: until He comes · 91–105</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-treasure-trust-watchfulness/\">← Treasure, Trust and Watchfulness</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/#part-two\">The Commandments of Christ: all subjects</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-index-by-verse/\">Index by Gospel verse →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"17px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#3e3e3e;font-size:17px\">What He gave His disciples to do together and to carry to the nations: the Supper, baptism and teaching, the sending, the shepherding of His flock.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"16px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#3e3e3e;font-size:16px\"><strong>On this page:</strong> <a href=\"#t6-1\">Do This in Remembrance of Me</a> · <a href=\"#t6-2\">Go and Make Disciples</a> · <a href=\"#t6-3\">The Sending</a> · <a href=\"#t6-4\">Shepherds of the Flock</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"saints-section\",\"anchor\":\"t6-1\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading saints-section\" id=\"t6-1\">Do This in Remembrance of Me</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k91\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k91\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>91.</strong> To take and eat: this is His body; to drink of the cup: this is His blood of the covenant; to do this in remembrance of Him.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And He took bread, and having given thanks, He broke it and gave it to them, saying, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“This is My body, which is given for you; do this in remembrance of Me.”</mark> And likewise the cup after supper, saying, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“This cup is the new covenant in My blood, poured out for you.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-22/#v22-19\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 22:19–20\">Luke 22:19–20</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-26/#v26-26\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 26:26–28\">Matthew 26:26–28</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-14/#v14-22\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 14:22–24\">Mark 14:22–24</a><br><strong>In the Law:</strong> <a href=\"/instructions/#study-15\">15. Passover and remembrance of deliverance</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k92\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k92\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>92.</strong> Unless you eat the flesh of the Son of Man and drink His blood, you have no life in yourselves.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So Jesus said to them, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Amen, amen, I tell you: unless you eat the flesh of the Son of Man and drink His blood, you have no life in yourselves.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The one who eats My flesh and drinks My blood has eternal life, and I will raise him up on the last day.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">For My flesh is true food, and My blood is true drink.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The one who eats My flesh and drinks My blood remains in Me, and I in him.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-6/#v6-53\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 6:53–56\">John 6:53–56</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"saints-section\",\"anchor\":\"t6-2\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading saints-section\" id=\"t6-2\">Go and Make Disciples</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k93\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k93\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>93.</strong> To go and make disciples of all the nations, baptizing them into the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, and teaching them to observe everything He commanded.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And Jesus came and spoke to them, saying, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“All authority in heaven and upon earth has been given to Me.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Go therefore and make disciples of all the nations, baptizing them into the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit,</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">teaching them to keep all that I commanded you; and behold, I am with you all the days, until the consummation of the age.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-28/#v28-18\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 28:18–20\">Matthew 28:18–20</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-16/#v16-15\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 16:15–16\">Mark 16:15–16</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><small><strong>Textual note:</strong> The parallel <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-16/#v16-15\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 16:15–16\">Mark 16:15–16</a> is part of Mark’s longer ending; see the linked chapter’s textual notes.</small></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k94\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k94\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>94.</strong> That repentance and forgiveness of sins be proclaimed in His name to all the nations; to remain in the city until clothed with power from on high.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>and said to them, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Thus it is written that the Christ should suffer and rise from the dead on the third day,</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">and that repentance for the forgiveness of sins should be proclaimed in His name to all the nations—beginning from Jerusalem.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">You are witnesses of these things.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">And behold, I am sending out the promise of My Father upon you; but remain in the city until you are clothed with power from on high.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-24/#v24-46\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 24:46–49\">Luke 24:46–49</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/discipleship/acts/chapter-1/#v1-4\" title=\"Saints Translation — Acts 1:4–5\">Acts 1:4–5</a> · <a href=\"/bible/discipleship/acts/chapter-1/#v1-8\" title=\"Saints Translation — Acts 1:8\">Acts 1:8</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k95\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k95\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>95.</strong> As the Father has sent Me, I also send you. Receive the Holy Spirit; whose sins you forgive are forgiven.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Then Jesus said to them again, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Peace to you. Just as the Father has sent Me, I also send you.”</mark> And having said this, He breathed and says to them, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Receive the Holy Spirit.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">If you forgive the sins of any, they have been forgiven them; if you retain those of any, they have been retained.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-20/#v20-21\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 20:21–23\">John 20:21–23</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"saints-section\",\"anchor\":\"t6-3\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading saints-section\" id=\"t6-3\">The Sending</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k96\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k96\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>96.</strong> To proclaim that the kingdom has drawn near, to heal the sick; freely you received, freely give.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">As you go, proclaim, ‘The kingdom of the heavens has drawn near.’</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Heal the sick, raise the dead, cleanse lepers, cast out demons. Freely you received; freely give.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-10/#v10-7\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 10:7–8\">Matthew 10:7–8</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-9/#v9-2\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 9:2\">Luke 9:2</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-10/#v10-9\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 10:9\">Luke 10:9</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k97\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k97\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>97.</strong> To take nothing for the road, to remain in one house, and to shake off the dust where you are not received.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He instructed them to take nothing for the journey except a staff alone: no bread, no bag, no copper money in their belt, but to wear sandals, and, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Do not put on two tunics.”</mark> He said to them, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Wherever you enter a house, remain there until you leave that place.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Whatever place does not receive you, and whose people do not listen to you, shake off the dust beneath your feet as you leave there, as a testimony to them.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-6/#v6-8\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 6:8–11\">Mark 6:8–11</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-10/#v10-9\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 10:9–14\">Matthew 10:9–14</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-9/#v9-3\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 9:3–5\">Luke 9:3–5</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-10/#v10-4\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 10:4–11\">Luke 10:4–11</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k98\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k98\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>98.</strong> When they hand you over, not to be anxious how or what you will speak.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">When they hand you over, do not be anxious about how or what you should speak, for what you should speak will be given to you at that hour.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">For it is not you who speak, but the Spirit of your Father who speaks in you.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-10/#v10-19\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 10:19–20\">Matthew 10:19–20</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-13/#v13-11\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 13:11\">Mark 13:11</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-12/#v12-11\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 12:11–12\">Luke 12:11–12</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-21/#v21-14\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 21:14–15\">Luke 21:14–15</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k99\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k99\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>99.</strong> When they persecute you in one city, to flee to the next.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">When they persecute you in this city, flee to the other. For truly I tell you, you will certainly not finish going through the cities of Israel until the Son of Man comes.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-10/#v10-23\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 10:23\">Matthew 10:23</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k100\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k100\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>100.</strong> To rejoice and be glad when you are reviled and persecuted for His sake.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Blessed are you when they revile you and persecute you and falsely speak every evil thing against you for My sake.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Rejoice and be glad, for great is your reward in the heavens; for thus they persecuted the prophets before you.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-5/#v5-11\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 5:11–12\">Matthew 5:11–12</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-6/#v6-22\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 6:22–23\">Luke 6:22–23</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k101\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k101\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>101.</strong> Not to rejoice that the spirits submit to you, but that your names are written in the heavens.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Nevertheless, do not rejoice in this, that the spirits submit to you, but rejoice that your names have been written in the heavens.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-10/#v10-20\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 10:20\">Luke 10:20</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k102\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k102\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>102.</strong> Not to stop the one who does a mighty work in His name: whoever is not against us is for us.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Jesus said, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Do not stop him, for no one who does a mighty work in My name will be able soon afterward to speak evil of Me.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">For whoever is not against us is for us.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-9/#v9-39\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 9:39–40\">Mark 9:39–40</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-9/#v9-50\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 9:50\">Luke 9:50</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"saints-section\",\"anchor\":\"t6-4\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading saints-section\" id=\"t6-4\">Shepherds of the Flock</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k103\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k103\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>103.</strong> To feed His lambs and shepherd His sheep.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So when they had eaten breakfast, Jesus says to Simon Peter, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Simon, son of John, do you love Me more than these?”</mark> He says to Him, “Yes, Lord, Thou knowest that I love Thee.” He says to him, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Feed My lambs.”</mark> He says to him again a second time, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Simon, son of John, do you love Me?”</mark> He says to Him, “Yes, Lord, Thou knowest that I love Thee.” He says to him, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Shepherd My sheep.”</mark> He says to him the third time, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Simon, son of John, do you love Me?”</mark> Peter was grieved because He said to him the third time, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Do you love Me?”</mark> And he said to Him, “Lord, Thou knowest all things; Thou knowest that I love Thee.” Jesus says to him, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Feed My sheep.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-21/#v21-15\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 21:15–17\">John 21:15–17</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k104\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k104\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>104.</strong> When you have turned back, to strengthen your brothers.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">But I prayed for you, that your faith might not fail; and you, once you have turned back, strengthen your brothers.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-22/#v22-32\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 22:32\">Luke 22:32</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k105\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k105\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>105.</strong> Whatever you bind on earth will be bound in heaven.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Truly I tell you, whatever you bind upon earth will have been bound in heaven, and whatever you loose upon earth will have been loosed in heaven.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-18/#v18-18\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 18:18\">Matthew 18:18</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-16/#v16-19\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 16:19\">Matthew 16:19</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-wide\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-treasure-trust-watchfulness/\">← Treasure, Trust and Watchfulness</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/#part-two\">The Commandments of Christ: all subjects</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-index-by-verse/\">Index by Gospel verse →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#8a8a8a\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#8a8a8a\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"14px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#8a8a8a;font-size:14px\">Saints Translation · The Commandments of Christ · gathered from His own words in the four Gospels; statements in our own words; passages quoted from the Saints Translation with His words in red · working draft awaiting specialist review.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
}
